build/
CMakeUserPresets.json
.claude/
*.aps
# screenshots/ is tracked, PNGs included. They are generated by
# client_screenshot_generator, but a generated artifact under review is the
# point: a UI change shows up as an image diff instead of being noticed the
# next time somebody refreshes the manual. The web client's screenshots/ is
# tracked for the same reason.
#
# Regenerate from the Windows pipeline. Offscreen Qt renders with the host's
# fonts, so a macOS run produces different bytes for the same UI and would
# commit as spurious churn — see docs/ops/client-screenshots.md.

# macOS Finder metadata. Committed by accident and untracked on 2026-08-01;
# a bare pattern matches at every depth, which is what is wanted — these
# appear in whichever directory Finder happens to open.
.DS_Store
